rawLyrics_en:
1: Khallo cha jivan, naath ati nai ghin-laagdo,
Tapaaiň-ko yogye-ko chaina swobhaab mero;
Khaai Thokara laDeň dher, lajjit yes jivanmaa,
Tapaaiň-ko nimti, prabhu laabh chaina kehi mamaa;
SaDe-ko mero deha maagnuhun-cha prabhu,
Thaakeň ma aafaisita, thaaknuhunna, he prabhu.

2: Bhayeň ma baalak KhrisT-ko taapani chu hataash;
Pavitra prem uhaaň-ko garda-chu kina naash;
Durgandha paap-ko ati ma-laai nisaasda-cha,
Jagaaune dos-ko bhaale sadhaiň nai baasda-cha
Cakit ma jhan-jhan chu, sun-chu jaba aawaaj,
Fi-kaa yesto jivan-laai daan cha Yeshu-ko raajye.

3: Patyaaunu gaahro laag-cha prem kasto gahiro,
Bekam-maa fosro maanis Yeshu-ko kaamlaagdo;
Dhiraji prabhu mero jharkannan masita,
UThaaunuhun-cha ma-laai laDda-chu jaba ma;
Riday-ko aashaa TuTos yaa fuTos mero man,
YethesTa KhrisT-ko premle ma hun-chu sushobhana.
